VALUES[en]("PURPOSE OF INTERNET USAGE")="0 Population (16–74 years)",
"1 Internet usage in last the 3 months","1.1 Sending or receiving e-mail","1.2 E-banking",
"1.3 Finding information about goods and services",
"1.3.1 Finding information about product safety or side effects, e.g. product composition, health risks",
"1.4 Reading online news sites, online newspapers, online news magazines",
"1.5 Telephoning over the Internet, video calls (via webcam)",
"1.6 Using instant messaging, i.e. exchanging messages via Skype, Viber, FaceTime, WhatsApp",
"1.7 Uploading self-created content to any website to be shared","1.8 Selling goods, services",
"1.9 Usage of storage space on the Internet for storing files",
"1.10 Listening to music or downloading music",
"1.10.1 Listening to music (e.g. web radio, music streaming)",
"1.10.2 Downloaded music via the Internet, e.g. via YouTube, SoundCloud",
"1.11 Listening to or downloading podcasts",
"1.12 Conducted health related activities over the Internet",
"1.12.1 Seeking of health-related information",
"1.12.1.1 Seeking of physical health related information",
"1.12.1.2 Seeking of mental health related information",
"1.12.2 Making an appointment with a practitioner via a website (e-health)",
"1.12.2.1 Making an appointment with a practitioner in the hospital via a web form, e.g. via the eNaroèanje application",
"1.12.2.2 Making an appointment with a chosen (family) practitioner via a web form",
"1.12.3 Accessing health records online, e.g. via the zVEM portal or other health services, e.g. access to electronic health data, e-prescriptions, e-referrals",
"1.12.3.1 Accessing health records online via the zVEM, e.g. access to electronic health data, e-prescriptions, e-referrals",
"1.12.3.1.1 Accessing health records online via the zVEM website, e.g. access to electronic health data, e-prescriptions, e-referrals",
"1.12.3.1.2 Accessing health records online via the zVEM app, e.g. access to electronic health data, e-prescriptions, e-referrals",
"1.12.3.2 Accessing health records online via other health services, e.g. Portal za paciente",
"1.12.4 Communication with a physician via the zVEM website or app, e.g. sending a message, requesting a prescription, making an appointment",
"1.12.5 Using other health services via a website or app instead of having to go to the hospital or visit a doctor, e.g. by getting a prescription or a consultation online",
"1.13 Using eZdravje services on the zVEM portal, e.g. eNaroèanje, access to own medical records",
"1.14 Making appointment with practitioner via a web form",
"1.15 Participation in social or professional networks","1.15.1 Participation in social networks",
"1.15.1.1 Every day or almost every day","1.15.1.2 At least once a week",
"1.15.1.3 Less than once a week","1.15.2 Participating in professional social networks",
"1.16 Watching internet streamed TV (live or catch-up) from TV broadcasters",
"1.17 Watching video on demand from commercial services",
"1.18 Watching video content from sharing services (e.g. YouTube)",
"1.19 Conducted learning activities over the Internet",
"1.19.1 Doing an online course or distance learning for educational purposes",
"1.19.1.1 Doing an online course",
"1.19.1.2 Distance learning for educational purposes, e.g. by using MS Teams, Zoom applications",
"1.19.2 Using online learning material (e.g. audio-visual materials, electronic textbooks, online learning software)",
"1.19.3 Communication with instructors or students using educational websites or portals",
"1.19.4 Communicating with educators or learners using audio or video online tools, e.g. MS Teams, Zoom",
"1.19.5 Purpose of learning activities – formal education, e.g. school or university",
"1.19.6 Purpose of learning activities – professional or work-related",
"1.19.7 Purpose of learning activities – private purposes, e.g. YouTube",
"1.20 Looking for information about education",
"1.21 Interaction via the Internet with households equipment or appliances, e.g. light bulb, thermostat, robot vacuum, security system",
"1.22 Playing or downloading games","1.23 Looking for a job or sending a job application",
"1.24 Expressing (posting, liking) opinions on civic or political issues",
"1.25 Taking part in online consultations (or voting) to define civic or political issues",
"1.26 Using open source services or programs",
"1.26.1 Using an open source internet browser, e.g. Mozilla Firefox, Chromium, Brave",
"1.26.2 Using an open source text, picture, sound or graphics editor, e.g. LibreOffice, Open Office, Inkscape, GIMP, Audacity, Blender",
"1.26.3 Using an open source online encyclopedia (e.g. .Wikipedia), an open source map (e.g. Open Street Map) or open source messaging or videoconferencing software (e.g. Jitsi Meet)",
"1.26.4 Using open source software for managing web content (e.g. WordPress) or for storing, sharing documents on the Internet online data storage space (e.g. Nextcloud)",
"1.27 Conducted educational activities over the Internet in the last 12 months due to COVID-19",
"1.27.1 Doing an online course (e.g. webinar, online workshop) in the last 12 months due to COVID-19",
"1.27.2 Distance learning for educational purposes (e.g. by using MS Teams, Zoom applications) due to COVID-19",
"1.28 Usage of the Internet for professional purposes in the last 12 months",
"1.28.1 Conducted work-related activities over of the Internet in the last 12 months",
"1.28.2 Conducted remote work (remote access) activities over of the Internet in the last 12 months due to COVID-19",
"1.28.3 Conducted remote work (remote access) activities over of the Internet in the last 12 months",
"1.29 Arranged a transport service from another individual in the last 12 months",
"1.29.1 Arranged a transport service from another private individual arranged via intermediary website or app (e.g. prevoz.org) in the last 12 months",
"1.29.2 Arranged a transport service from another private individual arranged via other websites, app or social networks in the last 12 months",
"1.30 Arranged an accommodation, e.g. a room, apartment, house, holiday cottage etc., from another private individual in the last 12 months",
"1.30.1 Arranged an accommodation, e.g. a room, apartment, house, holiday cottage etc., from another private individual via intermediary websites or apps (e.g. Airbnb) in the last 12 months",
"1.30.2 Arranged an accommodation, e.g. a room, apartment, house, holiday cottage etc., from another private individual via other websites, apps or social networks in the last 12 months",
"1.31 Obtained paid work by using an intermediary website in the last 12 months, e.g. letgo, customnanny, Fiveer, Upwork, TaskRabbit, Freelancer, Amazon Mechanical Turk",
"1.31.1 Obtained paid work by using an intermediary website in the last 12 months presented an additional source of income",
"1.32 Obtain knowledge through online encyclopedias","1.33 Creating websites or blogs",
"1.34 Usage of services related to travel and accommodation","1.35 Downloading software",
"1.36 Using or opening payment accounts (e.g. PayPal) to pay for goods or services";
